{% set faqs = [
{question:"How do I order a custom cake?",answer:"Select Check Availability, provide the required date, and continue to WhatsApp. Share the occasion and design references there so the studio can guide you."},
{question:"How far in advance should I order?",answer:"Lead time depends on the date and design complexity. Check your required date first; more detailed or tiered designs generally benefit from earlier discussion."},
{question:"How does custom cake pricing work?",answer:"Pricing depends on the chosen design, size and finishing complexity. PureBakes confirms the details and quote during the direct enquiry; no unapproved public starting price is displayed."},
{question:"Can PureBakes customize a reference design?",answer:"Yes. References help communicate the direction you like. The studio can adapt palette, proportions and details into a made-to-order design."},
{question:"Are eggless cakes available?",answer:business.eggOptions},
{question:"What flavours are available?",answer:"Flavour options are discussed during the enquiry. The website does not infer a photographed cake’s flavour from its appearance."},
