{question:"Does PureBakes deliver across Hyderabad?",answer:business.delivery.display},
{question:"How is an order confirmed?",answer:"A 50% advance confirms the order. The remaining 50% is completed before pickup or before a delivery cab is booked."},
{question:"When is the remaining balance due?",answer:"The remaining balance is completed before pickup or before PureBakes books an assisted delivery cab."},
{question:"Who pays assisted delivery cab charges?",answer:"The customer pays the applicable cab charge. PureBakes can assist with arranging the cab after the cake payment is complete."},
{question:"Can I order a birthday cake?",answer:"Yes. Explore the birthday cake collection and gallery, then check availability for your required date."},
{question:"Does PureBakes create wedding and engagement cakes?",answer:"Yes. PureBakes creates made-to-order engagement and wedding cakes, with real examples available in the portfolio. Share the date and event direction to begin."},
{question:"Can I browse cake themes?",answer:"Yes. The cake themes hub links to approved floral, butterfly, jungle, princess, superhero, Spider-Man and unicorn collections."},
{question:"Which Hyderabad areas do you serve?",answer:"PureBakes serves celebrations across Hyderabad. The Areas We Serve map highlights 41 established service areas, but the pins are not a delivery boundary; share your location so we can check suitable cab arrangements."},
